K EAST, STRENGTH 100. SEEN: KITE FIRST FOOT, KITE BOWMEN, KITE ELEPHANTS.","cipher":null},{"seq":204,"t":1500,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1554,"retries":0},{"seq":205,"t":1500,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Doctrine dictates striking first. I must execute the plan: send cavalry to raid the Orchid camp for its standard, as per the doctrine. The orchid camp is relatively close. I will use my cavalry for this aggressive action."},{"seq":206,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c90","house":"rhino","letter":"L114","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1","s-west","orchid-camp"],"depart":1500,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT ORCHID CAMP.","cipher":null},{"seq":207,"t":1500,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1679,"retries":0},{"seq":208,"t":1500,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"My doctrine dictates holding the east ford with elephants/foot and archers on the north bank. kite-inf-1 (100) is at F3 (2w old), kite-arch-1 (100) is at N-East (2w old), and kite-ele-1 (100) is at N-East (2w old). I must reinforce/confirm positions. Tiger cav is at F3 (2w old). "},{"seq":209,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c91","house":"kite","letter":"L115","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":1800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":210,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c92","house":"kite","letter":"L116","kind":"order","to":"kite-ele-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":1800,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"NHNMDTJSR, DKHO TS NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":211,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c93","house":"kite","letter":"L117","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":1800,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":212,"t":1500,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1656,"retries":0},{"seq":213,"t":1500,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"My doctrine is to seek peace early, so I should send a letter. I need to move my forces to secure the middle ford (F2) while others fight. I will use a cipher for secrecy."},{"seq":214,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c94","house":"orchid","letter":"L118","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":1800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, IBQOD TK RKUTD LBJG IESSHM."},{"seq":215,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c95","house":"orchid","letter":"L119","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":1800,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, IBQOD TK RKUTD LBJG IESSHM."},{"seq":216,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c96","house":"orchid","letter":"L120","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village"],"depart":1800,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT ORCHID CAMP.","cipher":"LKWIMJ, DKHS BT KQODES OBIN."},{"seq":217,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c97","house":"orchid","letter":"L121","kind":"letter","to":"rhino-camp","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1","n-west","rhino-camp"],"depart":1800,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":"TQUOM"},{"seq":218,"t":1500,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1632,"retries":0},{"seq":219,"t":1500,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Doctrine dictates mass on East Ford late. Current units are near S-East/F3. Kite has units at F3 (inf) and F3 approaches (arch). I will reinforce F3 and prepare to take it, while screening against potential threats."},{"seq":220,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c98","house":"tiger","letter":"L122","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east"],"depart":1800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, HSNRB QK OKUQB TSJF PSOQ."},{"seq":221,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c99","house":"tiger","letter":"L123","kind":"order","to":"ti